sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Admin as Kbook Admin
    actor Owner as Restaurant Owner
    actor POS as Android POS
    actor Customer
    participant API as KhanaBook API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL
    participant EB as Easebuzz
    participant KYC as Easebuzz KYC CPV
    participant SET as Easebuzz Settlement
    actor Recon as Daily 6AM Job

    Note over Admin,SET: 1) ONBOARDING — one sub-merchant twin per outlet
    Admin->>API: Create sub-merchant draft (restaurantId)
    API->>DB: easebuzz_sub_merchant status=DRAFT
    API->>EB: /merchant/v1/submerchant/create (email|phone, MDR slabs)
    EB-->>API: submerchant_id
    API->>DB: status=PENDING_KYC, subMerchantId, slabs snapshot
    Admin->>API: Generate KYC access key
    API->>EB: generate_kyc_access_key
    EB-->>API: hosted KYC URL
    Owner->>KYC: Upload PAN/bank/GST/FSSAI docs
    EB-->>API: OTP auto-sent -> verified (OTP_SENT->VERIFIED)
    EB-->>API: MERCHANT_KYC_APPROVAL webhook (kyc_status=true)
    API->>DB: status=ACTIVE, save virtual account (+IFSC)
    Admin->>API: Create split label
    API->>EB: /split/v1/create label=sm_{id} (bank, IFSC)
    EB-->>API: label created (unique per parent, multi-use), payout_percentage ignored
    API->>DB: splitLabel, splitLabelVersion=0, bank snapshot

    Note over POS,SET: 2) PAYMENT + POST-SPLIT
    POS->>API: collect payment for billId
    API->>EB: /payment/initiateLink with sub_merchant_id
    EB-->>API: access_token/txnid/payment URL
    Customer->>EB: Pay via EasyCollect link
    EB-->>API: Payment webhook (verify reverse hash)
    API->>DB: Bill paid, gatewayTxnId, webhook event
    API->>EB: /post-split/v1/create (merchant_request_id idempotent, config=restaurant share only)
    EB-->>API: Split accepted (or SCEO2 invalid label -> whole call fails)
    API->>DB: commissionAmount, settledAt on success

    Note over SET,Recon: 3) SETTLEMENT (T+1) + RECONCILIATION
    SET-->>API: Payout webhook per cycle (payout_id, UTR, txnid, submerchant_id, label, peb_transaction_id)
    SET-->>Owner: restaurant share -> restaurant bank (payout_amount = total - commission - MDR/GST)
    SET-->>Admin: commission stays at parent (parent pays its own MDR on commission)
    Recon->>API: 06:00 IST runDailyReconciliation
    API->>EB: /settlements/v1/retrieve (date range)
    EB-->>API: rows (payment pass: txnid+amount; split pass: payout_amount vs total-commission)
    API->>Recon: RECONCILIATION ALERT on mismatch/missing/orphan (admin /reconciliation/splits)

    Note over API,SET: 4) MONEY-BACK PATHS — all debit the PARENT, never the twin
    Admin->>API: Refund (merchant_refund_id idempotent)
    API->>EB: /refund/v1/initiate (parent)
    EB-->>API: REFUND_INITIATED / REFUND_STATUS_UPDATE webhooks (ARN on refunded)
    EB-->>Admin: Refund deducted from PARENT settlement (no auto split-reversal)
    EB-->>API: CASE_STATUS_UPDATE webhook (chargeback) -> parent only, merchant_txn+udf1
    EB-->>Admin: dispute won -> auto-credit parent's next settlement
    Admin->>API: Clawback: NO reversal API -> manual adjust of future payout
    API->>DB: manual clawback ledger entry visible in restaurant settlement history

    Note over Admin,SET: 5) SUSPENSION -> CLOSURE
    Admin->>API: Update Sub-Merchant (suspend)
    EB-->>SET: blocks new txns; queued splits still complete
    Admin->>API: drain pending settlements, then request deactivation
    EB-->>API: twin deactivated (no public delete; VA frozen, label inactive)
    EB-->>Admin: post-closure refunds/chargebacks still hit PARENT